        <item>
            <title>2.13.52</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 03:41:16 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>159</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.52</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.52

- The lyrics keep the elastic, wave-like line change introduced in the last version, but it now costs a fraction of what it did. The previous release computed the motion continuously while the lines moved, which was heavy enough to be worth doing differently; each line now carries its own tuned spring instead, matched against the original simulation so the movement looks the same.
]]></description>
